<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.430
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:24.440
Act One

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:28.360
Act One

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:28.360
Act One

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:39.330
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:41.620
Is this all?

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.130
I guess they weren't very
wealthy after all.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.380
How cruel, after all you did rob
them at their wedding.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.180
Hey, look....

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.300
It's Castle Shirasagi.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:55.600
Castle Shirasagi?

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.800
Whose castle is it?

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:58.470
It's no one's castle.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:01:59.770
It's ownerless.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:04.100
A useless castle with no surrounding
mountains or land that is harvestable.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.940
Who is the fool that built that there?

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.990
Fine, let us rest at that castle tonight.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.320
You mustn't.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.570
How dare you try and scare me,
you old hag!

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.120
Do not approach that castle.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.290
It is the castle of the forgotten gods.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:21.330
Forgotten gods?

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.120
Evil spirits.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.290
Sounds interesting, let them
meet my blade.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.250
The forgotten gods cannot be
cut with a katana.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.300
They do not die.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.760
The forgotten gods are neither
alive nor dead.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:36.470
They have been around since
the beginning of time.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:39.060
Their existence is eternal.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.480
There is no such thing!

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:12.840
What an awful place.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.450
Watch out! There's rotten
wood everywhere.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.490
Please, can we go back?

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.080
It will be alright.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.300
Well...

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.590
You have no patience!

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:00.600
Hey, if you get away from me,
I'll kill you!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.930
You think you can kill me?
Go ahead and try!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.140
Come to me now!
I am losing my patience!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.940
One, two, three... four...

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.200
What?!

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.320
I caught you!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.340
It stinks! What the...?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.630
W-Wait!

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.180
Hey, what is happening? Kihei?

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:46.970
Hey, Kihei has vanished!
And there are less women...

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:49.270
Who cares... I'm busy.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.310
O-Okou!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.150
H-Help! H...e...l...p!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.990
<i>- Please let me through...</i>

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:08.290
H-Hey, what are you doing here?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.660
<i>- Won't you let me through.</i>

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:13.040
<i>- If you do not have business here...</i>

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.040
Where are we?

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:16.130
<i>- We will not let you through.</i>

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.130
This is the castle of Tomihime-sama.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.510
Tomihime? Hey, where
did you come from?

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.180
What beautiful women!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:30.850
Don't!

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.860
Don't do it... let's run.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.150
Let us dance together.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.290
O-Oyuki, Ogin...

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.880
Please... Help me...

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.850
A d...d...demon!

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:13.520
My hand slipped!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.560
You're terrible!

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.250
My Lord, is it not the perfect
weather for falconry?

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.340
Today is your first time
assisting the Lord.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:44.090
Make it your best effort.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:49.010
Are you the falconer Zushonosuke?

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:49.930
Yes.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.430
Is my falcon in good condition?

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.360
Please forgive me.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:02.490
He is a bit shy and is not familiar
with anyone besides myself yet.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:06.820
He is a precious falcon promised
to be presented to the Shogun.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:07.780
Sir!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.130
Impressive, My Lord!

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:23.920
I'm called the master of firearms
but I'm no match for you, My Lord!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.260
Good. Well done.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:32.310
Oh! Lord! It's a big one!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.770
Oh! Hurry!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.100
Release the falcon!

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.190
Sir!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.100
Go, Kojiro!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:45.610
What are you doing?
The boar is getting away!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.110
But, with this rain...

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:49.410
Argh! Release the falcon immediately!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:50.700
Sir...

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.630
My Lord, I strongly urge you
to wait for the rain to calm.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.550
Argh! Go now!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.720
Please wait!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.350
Kojiro! Come back to me!

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.890
That falcon is to be
presented to our Shogun!

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.310
What are you doing?!
Retrieve it at once!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.350
Sir!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:26.900
Kojiro!

00:08:56.770 --> 00:09:00.350
How could anyone leave
such an expensive kimono?

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.830
F- Forgive me!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:26.130
Surely, I had no idea there would
be anyone present in such a place!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:29.880
F-Forgive my intrusion.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.390
Did you happen to see a falcon fly by?

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.440
My apologies...

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:46.980
Tomihime-sama...

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:50.900
What is the matter?

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.610
How could you speak to a mere human?

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.700
We did not exchange any words.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:10:00.160
So then, why did you not conceal
yourself, or even kill him?

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:04.460
Yes, I forgot... to kill him.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.060
Kojiro!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:26.810
Kojiro!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:27.820
What is it?

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.440
Did you find the falcon?

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:30.940
Yes.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:33.650
It was headed towards that castle.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.410
Did you say that castle?

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.990
That can't be good.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.910
Evil spirits are known to reside there.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.000
But Kojiro flew toward...

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.290
I will send some men.

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.340
Welcome back.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.600
We have received a precious gift
from Kamehime of Inawashiro.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:05.520
The flesh of a renowned warrior
from the state of Izumo.

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:07.610
Surely, it shall satisfy your appetite.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:10.070
I have no appetite, some rice
gruel will do fine.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:12.440
You should refrain from eating
the food of humans.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:15.110
It isn't bad once you try it.

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:18.950
Hime-sama, we are the forgotten gods.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.540
If we do not eat humans we will
lose our strength.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:22.870
I am aware of that.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.670
Even worse, if you ever fell for a human...

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.170
What are you referring to?

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.050
We didn't exchange any words.

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:35.550
The possibility of you
falling in love with a human...

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:38.140
The thought alone makes me shudder.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.390
I am aware.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:46.730
It cannot be...

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:01.870
Is it you, Aguri? Is it really you?

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.080
You are Aguri!

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:08.370
Aguri... welcome home.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.640
Zushonosuke-san.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.220
Oshizu...

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.720
I've heard the Lord's precious
falcon has gone missing.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:28.310
Yes, I was just about to join
the men in the search.

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:30.900
Please don't.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:35.440
I've heard that none of the
men have returned.

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:38.780
People are saying that the
fault is not with you.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.160
Kojiro is the first falcon the Lord
has entrusted me with.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.950
I have put my heart into raising him.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:48.660
No... We are dear friends
who grew together.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.290
I cannot neglect a friend.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:54.170
Which is more important to you,
the falcon or me?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.170
Both.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:13:00.590
If I were captive in Castle Shirasagi,
would you come find me?

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:03.800
Do not be foolish, you must not worry.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.270
Kojiro!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.480
Kojiro!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.490
Kojiro! Kojiro!

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:45.680
Are you all right?

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:48.850
There are bandits in this area.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:53.520
Are you being chased?

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.910
I saw you in my dream.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:10.700
The encounter the other day seemed
much like a dream.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.290
So I guess what I saw was
a dream within a dream.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.920
It was as though you were
from a different world.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.670
Pardon my rudeness.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.510
But then you are partly to blame as well.

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:21.590
You were there undressed.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.260
It's dangerous around here.
Let me take you home.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.770
Please.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.600
I've finally heard your voice.

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.440
As I thought, it wasn't
a dream after all.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.560
Where is your home?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.650
Is it beyond that castle?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.700
You look like you are
from a respectable family.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.370
Perhaps the lumber merchant
next town over?

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.450
You are close.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.040
Then you should be cautious all the more.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.120
You are a perfect target for bandits.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:54.080
And also...

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.170
Also?

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.380
There is a rumor that evil spirits
have been seen in this vicinity.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.500
Evil spirits?

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.460
Yes, at the moment
it is hidden behind the fog,

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:04.590
but a castle by the name of Shirasagi
is known to be inhabited by evil spirits.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.590
I am unfamiliar with the details,
but surely it is frightening.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.930
You are wrong.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.430
It's not the evil spirits
that reside there.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:14.600
They are forgotten gods.

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:16.270
Forgotten gods?

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.190
What are the forgotten gods?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:22.940
The forgotten gods and humans
came into existence together.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:26.780
Although... in the past they
were known simply as ''gods''.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:32.290
Both shared this world,
yet segregated from one another.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.960
But all of that changed when...

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.790
the humans set foot
into our sacred territory.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:42.340
Similarly, the gods manifested
themselves into the human realm.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.630
Humans began pretending
they were gods...

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.380
and ruled the mountains and oceans.

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:49.850
The gods pretending to be human,
soon became the forgotten gods.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:55.270
However, these two entities were never
meant to intermingle with one another.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:59.690
Once the spirits of trees and water
began to disappear,

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:02.270
the forgotten gods were the
first to go hungry.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:04.230
The forgotten gods...

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.950
...began to eat humans.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.160
Humans?

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.070
Yes, if they don't...

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.030
They couldn't live?

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:16.160
Not so. Eating humans is their only
means to escape from pain and suffering.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.210
The forgotten gods neither
bear children nor perish.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.830
They don't die?

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:22.420
There are some exceptions.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.920
They must never associate with
humans or fall in love with one.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.680
When a forgotten god falls in love
with a human,

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.720
it becomes corrupted and eventually dies.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:37.730
Would you like to try some sweets
from the western world?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:43.270
They are called konpeitou, my falcon
for some odd reason loved these.

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.280
They are however, very pricy...

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.530
...and only the Lord's bird
would be permitted such a luxury.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:48.780
Please, try one.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.830
Very sweet, isn't it?

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.290
Do you not like sweets?

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.170
I apologize...

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:06.510
The fog is getting dense.
Let's hurry.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:10.760
Who goes there?

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.050
Forgotten gods?

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:16.350
No, these are evil spirits.

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.060
Hand over the woman!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.690
Leave at once! Or else
I will cut you down!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.900
This fool makes me laugh.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:29.070
Let's have him try it.

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.070
Stand back!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.300
Wait!

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.260
Are you all right? Your wound...

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.470
Wound?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.310
The broken blade...

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:03.230
How could this be... your cut
is so deep, yet...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.520
You... are...

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:07.650
How on earth...?

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:27.960
As I thought... your wound.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.770
Mother! Please don't leave me.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:49.320
Let me take you to my home town
and I will care for your wound.

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:53.070
This is fine, I will return
home on my own.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:54.780
But... your wound.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:58.580
I understand...

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:02.500
May I please have one of those again?

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:04.410
The sweet ones.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:05.540
Oh, yes.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:14.510
Um... May I have your name?

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.510
I don't have a name.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:22.020
This is also a dream within a dream.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.150
This is...

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.450
Hey, hey, samurai-san!

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.450
That's better...

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.870
How could you do that to someone
that just saved your life?

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.170
Saved my life?

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:51.710
Yeah, we just saved you
from a lot of trouble.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.170
What are you saying?

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.470
As I thought, this guy is clueless.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:59.930
That girl you were just with,
she's a forgotten god.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.890
She's the princess of the forgotten gods.

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.430
Don't play with me...

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:09.400
She was probably trying to take you
to the castle to feast on you.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.060
See, look.

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:18.030
If you don't wanna die, go back
to where you call home.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:25.330
It's meaningless to give such
a thing to a forgotten god.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:27.870
They don't have a sense of taste.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.670
They can't tell whether they are
eating something sweet or salty.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.110
Hime-sama! Where have you been?!

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:53.820
Susuki, please tell me...

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:57.440
what the sensation called
''sweet'' is like.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:58.740
Pardon?

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:02.370
To have that moment again...

